      "typeInterval": 72
    },
    {
      "id": "scene000-02",
      "scene": "scene000",
      "text": "今宵は、ひとつの昔話を聞かせよう。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "typeInterval": 65
    },
    {
      "id": "scene000-03",
      "scene": "scene000",
      "text": "これは、雨の夜に拾われた少年と、小さな守護豚の物語じゃ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "typeInterval": 65
    },
    {
      "id": "scene000-04",
      "scene": "scene000",
      "text": "さぁ、ページをめくろうかの。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "typeInterval": 65,
      "advanceSe": "../assets/audio/se/page_turn_01.mp3?v=20260712-opening",
      "advanceAmbience": "../assets/audio/ambience/rain_loop_01.mp3?v=20260712-rain",
      "nextSceneId": "scene001-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene001-01",
      "scene": "scene001",
      "text": "その夜、王と王妃を乗せた馬車は、冷たい雨の中を進んでおった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "background": "../assets/cg/scene_royal_carriage_rain_01.png?v=20260712",
      "characters": [],
      "bgm": null,
      "ambience": "../assets/audio/ambience/rain_loop_01.mp3?v=20260712-rain",
      "transitionDurationMs": 2600,
      "revealOnly": true,
      "ambienceVolume": 0.18,
      "se": "../assets/audio/ambience/bell_far_01.mp3?v=20260704",
      "seVolume": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "scene001-02",
      "scene": "scene001",
      "text": "ただの巡幸ではない。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene001-03",
      "scene": "scene001",
      "text": "二人は、いつか現れるという“運命の子”を探しておったのじゃ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "autoAdvanceMs": 1600,
      "forceTransition": true,
      "nextSceneId": "scene002a-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002a-01",
      "scene": "scene002a",
      "text": "「……いつの日か、運命の子は現れるのでしょうか。」",
      "background": "../assets/cg/scene_king_queen_carriage_interior_01.png?v=20260712",
      "characters": [],
      "icon": null,
      "speaker": "王妃",
      "bgm": null,
      "ambience": "../assets/audio/ambience/rain_loop_01.mp3?v=20260712-rain",
      "ambienceVolume": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002a-02",
      "scene": "scene002a",
      "text": "「あの方のお言葉を……今も信じておられるのですね。」",
      "speaker": "王妃",
      "startDelayMs": 900
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002a-03",
      "scene": "scene002a",
      "text": "「豚のおじさんは、嘘をつかぬ。」",
      "speaker": "王"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002a-04",
      "scene": "scene002a",
      "text": "『豚のおじさん』……。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002a-05",
      "scene": "scene002a",
      "text": "その話は、まだ少し早いの。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002a-06",
      "scene": "scene002a",
      "text": "じゃが、王があれほど信じるには、それだけの理由があったということじゃ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "nextSceneId": "scene002b-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002b-01",
      "scene": "scene002b",
      "text": "馬車が、雨の石畳の上で急に止まった。",
      "background": "../assets/cg/scene_king_queen_carriage_interior_01.png?v=20260712",
      "characters": [],
      "icon": null,
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "bgm": null,
      "ambience": "../assets/audio/ambience/rain_loop_01.mp3?v=20260712-rain",
      "ambienceVolume": 0.18,
      "effect": "shake"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002b-02",
      "scene": "scene002b",
      "text": "「陛下！」",
      "speaker": "御者",
      "effect": null
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002b-03",
      "scene": "scene002b",
      "text": "「あそこに……子どもが！」",
      "speaker": "御者"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002b-04",
      "scene": "scene002b",
      "text": "雨の向こうに、ひとりの少年が倒れておった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "background": "../assets/cg/scene_child_found_in_rain_01.png?v=20260712",
      "characters": [],
      "icon": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "ambience": "../assets/audio/ambience/rain_loop_01.mp3?v=20260712-rain",
      "ambienceVolume": 0.18,
      "action": "pause"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-01",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "少年が目を覚ましたのは、城の下男宿舎じゃった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "background": "../assets/bg/servants_dormitory_morning.png?v=20260704",
      "characters": [],
      "bgm": null,
      "ambience": "../assets/audio/ambience/birds_morning_01.mp3?v=20260704-birds1",
      "ambienceVolume": 0.22
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-02",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "豪華ではない。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-03",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "じゃが、雨風をしのげる屋根があり、温かい寝床があった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-04",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "孤児であった少年にとっては、それだけで十分すぎる場所じゃった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-05",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「起きたか。」",
      "speaker": "下男A",
      "icon": null
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-06",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「ほら、朝飯。」",
      "speaker": "下男B"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-07",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「冷める前に食えよ。」",
      "speaker": "下男B"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-08-name",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "action": "nameInput"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-09",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「{playerName}か。」",
      "speaker": "下男A"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-10",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「今日からお前も仲間だ。」",
      "speaker": "下男A"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-11",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「よろしくな、{playerName}！」",
      "speaker": "下男B"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-12",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「……はい。」",
      "speaker": "主人公"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-13",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "この短い返事から、少年の新しい日々が始まったのじゃ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "forceTransition": true,
      "ambienceFadeOutMs": 800,
      "nextSceneId": "scene004-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-01",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "少年はよく働いた。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "background": "../assets/bg/servants_dormitory_morning.png?v=20260704",
      "characters": [],
      "bgm": null,
      "ambience": null
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-02",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "掃除。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-03",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "薪運び。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-04",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "馬小屋の世話。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-05",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "できることは多くなかったが、それでも毎日を懸命に生きておった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-06",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "誰かの役に立つ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-07",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "それは、少年にとって初めて知る喜びでもあった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-08",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「おい、{playerName}！」",
      "speaker": "下男A",
      "icon": null
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-09",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「今日も助かったぞ。」",
      "speaker": "下男A"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-10",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「……ありがとうございます。」",
      "speaker": "主人公"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-11",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「お前、口数は少ないけど根性あるよな。」",
      "speaker": "下男B"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-12",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「ま、下男としては合格だ。」",
      "speaker": "下男A"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-13",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「……はい。」",
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "nextSceneId": "scene005-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene005-01",
      "scene": "scene005",
