      "text": "地下は冷たく、暗かった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "startDelayMs": 2000
    },
    {
      "id": "scene006-09",
      "scene": "scene006",
      "text": "水滴の音だけが、やけに大きく響いておった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene006-10",
      "scene": "scene006",
      "text": "まったく、わしが見ていても、ぞっとするほどの孤独じゃった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
